[% IF c.session.debug_mode == 1 %][% PageVersion %][% END %]

<div class="container masterplan">

<h1 id="top">Documentation Master Plan</h1>

<div class="last-updated doc-muted">
    Created: 2026-08-25 &nbsp;|&nbsp; Version: 1.0 &nbsp;|&nbsp; Status: COORDINATOR
    &nbsp;|&nbsp; Parent project: <a href="/project/details?project_id=138" class="doc-link">#138 PLANNING</a>
</div>

<p>This is the <strong>single entry point for documentation work</strong>. It does not replace any
sub-plan — it links them, records the current audit, and lists the work items. Every
sub-plan below remains the authoritative spec for its own area. This plan follows the
<a href="[% c.uri_for('/Documentation/PlanningLanguageStandard') %]">Planning Language Standard</a>:
PROJECT = PLAN, PHASE = sub-project, STEP = todo. No abstract "Phase N".</p>

<div class="notice">
    <strong>Where docs live (the rule):</strong> the <em>only</em> documentation directory the
    application serves is <code>Comserv/root/Documentation/</code> (the app resolves it via
    <code>path_to('root','Documentation')</code>). Anything an AI or human writes to the
    repo-root <code>Documentation/</code> folder is <strong>invisible to the app</strong>
    (and is a duplicate of served files, or lost). Write documentation under
    <code>Comserv/root/Documentation/</code> only.
</div>

<h2 id="summary">Summary (read this first)</h2>

<table class="doc-table">
    <tr><th class="doc-th">Finding</th><th class="doc-th">Measured</th><th class="doc-th">Meaning</th></tr>
    <tr><td class="doc-td">Real doc directory</td><td class="doc-td"><code>Comserv/root/Documentation/</code></td><td class="doc-td">Only dir the app serves. ~827 files.</td></tr>
    <tr><td class="doc-td">AI misplacement</td><td class="doc-td">repo-root <code>Documentation/</code></td><td class="doc-td">Duplicates served files + <code>DailyPlans/</code> the app never sees. Stop writing here.</td></tr>
    <tr><td class="doc-td">Theming compliance</td><td class="doc-td">208 / 606 <code>.tt</code> use <code>var(--*)</code> (34%)</td><td class="doc-td">398 docs break on non-default themes — biggest gap.</td></tr>
    <tr><td class="doc-td">Metadata</td><td class="doc-td">META 455/606 (75%), PageVersion 487/606 (80%)</td><td class="doc-td">~120 pages render without title/META.</td></tr>
    <tr><td class="doc-td">Module landing pages</td><td class="doc-td">10 / 34 modules have <code>index.tt</code></td><td class="doc-td">24 modules have no navigable entry.</td></tr>
    <tr><td class="doc-td">Stray / stale</td><td class="doc-td">49 stray <code>.md</code>, 62 stale <code>PycharmProjects</code> paths</td><td class="doc-td">Hygiene debt under the served tree.</td></tr>
    <tr><td class="doc-td">Changelog</td><td class="doc-td">149 per-entry <code>.inc</code> fragments</td><td class="doc-td">Healthy — the model to follow.</td></tr>
</table>

