<h2 id="workitems">Work items (each = a STEP/todo under this plan)</h2>

<p>These are the concrete jobs. Track them as todos under project <strong>#138 DOCMASTER</strong>
(child of #138 PLANNING). No "Phase N" labels — each item names what it is.</p>

<table class="doc-table">
    <tr><th class="doc-th">Work item</th><th class="doc-th">Why</th><th class="doc-th">Size</th></tr>
    <tr><td class="doc-td">Theming sweep: migrate 398 unthemed <code>.tt</code> to <code>var(--*)</code></td><td class="doc-td">Biggest compliance gap; breaks on other themes</td><td class="doc-td">L</td></tr>
    <tr><td class="doc-td">Backfill META/PageVersion on ~120 missing <code>.tt</code> pages</td><td class="doc-td">Untitled/undated pages; weak search</td><td class="doc-td">M</td></tr>
    <tr><td class="doc-td">Add <code>index.tt</code> to the 24 modules lacking one</td><td class="doc-td">No navigable module entry</td><td class="doc-td">M</td></tr>
    <tr><td class="doc-td">Convert or archive 49 stray <code>.md</code> under served tree</td><td class="doc-td">Mixed formats in doc list</td><td class="doc-td">M</td></tr>
    <tr><td class="doc-td">Scrub 62 stale <code>PycharmProjects</code> paths</td><td class="doc-td">Wrong references</td><td class="doc-td">M</td></tr>
    <tr><td class="doc-td">Fix <code>README.tt</code>/<code>AGENTS.md</code> legacy <code>Comserv/docs/</code> refs</td><td class="doc-td">Dead pointers</td><td class="doc-td">S</td></tr>
    <tr><td class="doc-td">Add a docs lint to CI (META, PageVersion, theming, stray <code>.md</code>)</td><td class="doc-td">Prevent drift</td><td class="doc-td">M</td></tr>
    <tr><td class="doc-td">Stop AI misplacement: write only to <code>Comserv/root/Documentation/</code></td><td class="doc-td">Docs must be app-visible</td><td class="doc-td">S (rule + enforcement)</td></tr>
</table>

<h2 id="principles">Principles</h2>
<ul>
    <li><strong>One directory.</strong> <code>Comserv/root/Documentation/</code> is the only doc root. The repo-root <code>Documentation/</code> folder is a trap — do not use it.</li>
    <li><strong>One reader.</strong> The Documentation controller renders <code>.tt</code>; changelog is per-entry <code>.inc</code> (generated reader). Don't hand-edit generated files.</li>
    <li><strong>One vocabulary.</strong> Follow the Planning Language Standard. Link plans by project code, not by "Phase N".</li>
    <li><strong>Humans see plans.</strong> Every plan is a linkable in-app <code>.tt</code>; the summary table sits at the top of the coordinator.</li>
</ul>

<p class="doc-backtop"><a href="#top">&#8593; Back to Top</a></p>
